"tongjian_id":"b30ff9e8-db0e-11ef-b53d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安福郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"安福郡","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9e9-db0e-11ef-898b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9ea-db0e-11ef-b648-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新野縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新野县","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9eb-db0e-11ef-b494-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"棘陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"棘阳","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9ec-db0e-11ef-94c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新野郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"新野郡","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9ed-db0e-11ef-a85a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"食邑各有實土。「安富」，當作「安福」。五代志：淅陽郡武當縣，舊置武當郡。又，安福縣置安福郡。南陽郡之新野縣，舊日棘陽，置新野郡。濟，子禮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"食邑各有实土。「安富」，当作「安福」。五代志：淅阳郡武当县，旧置武当郡。又，安福县置安福郡。南阳郡之新野县，旧日棘阳，置新野郡。济，子礼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9e4-db0e-11ef-8622-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b30ff9de-db0e-11ef-aae1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yōu","source_anchor_text":"王達滕王逌並之國隨","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":67,"text":"逌","tongjian_id":"fef6216c-13f5-518f-a603-8bde205d8880"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"代國","place_name_jianti_auto":"代国","resolved_place_entity_id":5830,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b3125ead-db0e-11ef-9b0b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"五月，以襄國郡爲趙國，濟南郡爲陳國，武當、安富二郡爲越國，上黨郡爲代國，新野郡爲滕國，邑各萬戶；令趙王招、陳王純、越王盛、代王達、滕王逌並之國。","content_fanyi":"五月，将襄国郡改为赵国，济南郡改为陈国，武当、安富两郡改为越国，上党郡改为代国，新野郡改为滕国，食邑各一万户；命赵王宇文招、陈王宇文纯、越王宇文盛、代王宇文达、滕王宇文逌一同前往各自封国。","content_jianti_auto":"五月，以襄国郡为赵国，济南郡为陈国，武当、安富二郡为越国，上党郡为代国，新野郡为滕国，邑各万户；令赵王招、陈王纯、越王盛、代王达、滕王逌并之国。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16758,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十三 (陳紀七) / 高宗宣皇帝中之下 / 十一年 / 第 23 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b30ff9de-db0e-11ef-aae1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":579},"tongjian_id":"b30ff9de-db0e-11ef-aae1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"代國"},"message":"success","success":true}